      "html" : "<table cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 768px&#10;                ;\"><colgroup><col width=\"62.5%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Installation<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Continuous<br><\/br>Special Inspection<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Periodic<br><\/br>Special Inspection<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">1.&#160;&#160;&#160;Record the equipment and method used for installation and record the time for each foot of penetration from the start of installation until completion.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">2.&#160;&#160;&#160;For deep foundation elements requiring a rock socket:<\/div><\/div><div><div style=\"margin-left:45pt;text-indent:-45pt;margin-top:0pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;2.1.&#160;&#160;&#160;Record the equipment and method of drilling the rock socket. Record the top elevation and bottom elevation of rock socket, as well as the time for each foot of drilling the rock socket.<\/div><\/div><div><div style=\"margin-left:45pt;text-indent:-45pt;margin-top:0pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;2.2.&#160;&#160;&#160;Inspect the rock socket to verify rock quality as required by Section <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-179573', hash: '#JD_BC1812' }}\">1812<\/Link> and the construction documents. Record the results of the inspection and note whether or not the rock socket complies with the requirements of Section <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-179573', hash: '#JD_BC1812' }}\">1812<\/Link>.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>",
